description: One-line human comments with no colons or semicolons
alwaysApply: true
---

# Comments

When adding comments, use one line of plain human language.

Do not use `:` or `;` in comments.

Explain why or what the next block is for, not what the syntax does.

```ts
// BAD
// New run: wipe previous messages; mark it as running.

// GOOD
// New run wipe previous messages and mark it as in progress
```
